WEBVTT

1
00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:30.125


2
00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:35.666
<b>After reminding Arjun of his Kshatriya dharma</b>
<b>and his duty to fight,</b>

3
00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:37.916
<b>Lord Krishna says here,</b>

4
00:00:37.916 --> 00:00:39.458
<b>"O Partha,</b>

5
00:00:39.458 --> 00:00:43.750
<b>behold - it is as if the gates of heaven</b>
<b>have opened before you.</b>

6
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.000
<b>Blessed are you,</b>

7
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.875
<b>and blessed are those warriors</b>

8
00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:52.208
<b>who have received the opportunity</b>
<b>to participate in such a righteous war."</b>

9
00:00:52.791 --> 00:00:56.958


10
00:00:56.958 --> 00:01:01.291
<b>Here, Lord Krishna is trying to explain to Arjun</b>

11
00:01:01.291 --> 00:01:04.166
<b>that warfare is indeed his true calling.</b>

12
00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:06.166
<b>This is no ordinary battle</b>

13
00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:12.125
<b>this is a great war whose supreme purpose</b>
<b>is the establishment of dharma.</b>

14
00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:15.250
<b>Its teaching is to stop adharma,</b>

15
00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:19.958
<b>to instill in society the belief</b>
<b>that truth alone prevails.</b>

16
00:01:19.958 --> 00:01:25.458
<b>And in such a righteous war,</b>
<b>Arjun faces only two possibilities:</b>

17
00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:30.041
<b>either victory or a warrior's glorious death.</b>

18
00:01:30.041 --> 00:01:31.458
<b>If victory comes,</b>

19
00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:33.958
<b>dharma will triumph, truth will prevail,</b>

20
00:01:33.958 --> 00:01:39.041
<b>and Arjun will receive the</b>
<b>kingdom that is his moral right.</b>

21
00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:40.250
<b>And if he</b>

22
00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:45.416
<b>meets a warrior's end,</b>
<b>even then, Arjun will attain heaven.</b>

23
00:01:45.416 --> 00:01:51.208
<b>Both possibilities present a golden opportunity</b>
<b>for a Kshatriya like Arjun.</b>

24
00:01:51.208 --> 00:01:55.583
<b>There is another point that</b>
<b>Lord Krishna wishes to make.</b>

25
00:01:55.583 --> 00:01:58.958
<b>Arjun did not yearn for this war.</b>

26
00:01:58.958 --> 00:02:05.583
<b>This is merely the result of Duryodhan and</b>
<b>his associates' greed, their deceit and treachery.</b>

27
00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:08.666
<b>And when a war's very purpose is</b>
<b>the establishment of dharma,</b>

28
00:02:08.666 --> 00:02:13.083
<b>fulfilling one's duty completely</b>
<b>in such a noble cause,</b>

29
00:02:13.083 --> 00:02:18.541
<b>even attaining martyrdom in it,</b>
<b>is itself worthy of heavenly merit.</b>

30
00:02:18.541 --> 00:02:21.875
<b>This transcends the mere concepts</b>
<b>of victory and defeat.</b>

31
00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:23.125
<b>Arjun was disturbed</b>

32
00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:25.625
<b>by the thought of his loved ones' death,</b>

33
00:02:25.625 --> 00:02:27.875
<b>especially for Grandfather Bhishma</b>

34
00:02:27.875 --> 00:02:29.750
<b>and Teacher Drona.</b>

35
00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.500
<b>Krishna is trying to explain here</b>

36
00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:38.208
<b>that even they are merely fulfilling</b>
<b>their duty in this righteous cause.</b>

37
00:02:38.208 --> 00:02:39.958
<b>Even if they die,</b>

38
00:02:39.958 --> 00:02:42.291
<b>they too are destined for heaven,</b>

39
00:02:42.291 --> 00:02:45.333
<b>whose joy they shall surely receive.</b>

40
00:02:45.333 --> 00:02:48.833
<b>So you need not worry for them either.</b>

41
00:02:48.833 --> 00:02:51.291
<b>From every perspective, this war is just.</b>

42
00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:53.416
<b>Even for your own people,</b>

43
00:02:53.416 --> 00:02:55.625
<b>this war is right.</b>

44
00:02:55.625 --> 00:02:59.458
<b>So cast aside your hesitation.</b>

45
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.875


46
00:03:03.875 --> 00:03:11.583
<b>Everyone desires that golden opportunity</b>
<b>for success in life.</b>

47
00:03:11.583 --> 00:03:15.916
<b>Humans wait for such opportunities,</b>

48
00:03:15.916 --> 00:03:19.166
<b>but ironically,</b>

49
00:03:19.166 --> 00:03:24.791
<b>when no promising prospects</b>
<b>appear for a long time, </b>

50
00:03:24.791 --> 00:03:29.125
<b>they often sink into needless despair.</b>

51
00:03:29.125 --> 00:03:31.791
<b>We must remember that</b>

52
00:03:31.791 --> 00:03:38.458
<b>external circumstances and the arrival</b>
<b>of opportunities are not in our control,</b>

53
00:03:38.458 --> 00:03:39.708
<b>but</b>

54
00:03:39.708 --> 00:03:43.333
<b>staying prepared for such opportunities</b>

55
00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:47.708
<b>certainly lies in our hands.</b>

56
00:03:47.708 --> 00:03:53.875
<b>We should focus on our</b>
<b>daily practice and preparation,</b>

57
00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:58.250
<b>for no opportunity announces</b>
<b>its arrival in advance.</b>

58
00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:03.833
<b>Let it not be that one day</b>
<b>opportunity knocks at your door,</b>

59
00:04:03.833 --> 00:04:08.541
<b>only to find your preparation incomplete.</b>

60
00:04:08.541 --> 00:04:12.666
<b>This isn't just about skills and talents,</b>

61
00:04:12.666 --> 00:04:16.166
<b>but also about your mental fortitude.</b>

62
00:04:16.166 --> 00:04:18.250
<b>Take Arjun for example</b>

63
00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:24.083
<b>for a Kshatriya like him, this war is a</b>
<b>golden opportunity from a spiritual perspective.</b>

64
00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:28.791
<b>He lacks neither skill nor valor,</b>

65
00:04:28.791 --> 00:04:30.125
<b>yet</b>

66
00:04:30.125 --> 00:04:34.166
<b>at this moment, it is his mind that wavers.</b>

67
00:04:34.166 --> 00:04:36.541
<b>Keep your mind prepared as well.</b>

68
00:04:36.541 --> 00:04:39.083
<b>Know this universal truth</b>

69
00:04:39.083 --> 00:04:46.041
<b>opportunity knocks at the door</b>
<b>of those who are ready for it.</b>

70
00:04:46.041 --> 00:04:49.250
<b>One can understand it this way:</b>

71
00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.666
<b>when you are prepared,</b>

72
00:04:51.666 --> 00:04:54.208
<b>your confidence grows,</b>

73
00:04:54.208 --> 00:04:57.000
<b>your thinking becomes positive,</b>

74
00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:03.750
<b>and this very positive mindset helps you</b>
<b>recognize more opportunities.</b>

75
00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.583
<b>Don't wait</b>

76
00:05:05.583 --> 00:05:07.458
<b>prepare,</b>

77
00:05:07.458 --> 00:05:08.958
<b>stay positive,</b>

78
00:05:08.958 --> 00:05:11.583
<b>and when an opportunity comes,</b>

79
00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:15.916
<b>give it your absolute hundred percent.</b>

80
00:05:16.583 --> 00:05:20.666


81
00:05:20.666 --> 00:05:25.916
<b>All parents wish for their children's success.</b>

82
00:05:25.916 --> 00:05:30.375
<b>They prepare their children with this aim in mind.</b>

83
00:05:30.375 --> 00:05:34.041
<b>Sometimes through the incentive of rewards,</b>

84
00:05:34.041 --> 00:05:36.416
<b>sometimes through their guidance,</b>

85
00:05:36.416 --> 00:05:42.250
<b>their children take all the steps</b>

86
00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:45.875
<b>that will lead them to the pinnacle of victory.</b>

87
00:05:45.875 --> 00:05:49.333
<b>And this is completely natural.</b>

88
00:05:49.333 --> 00:05:50.958
<b>However,</b>

89
00:05:50.958 --> 00:05:56.500
<b>in doing so, they often forget </b>

90
00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:02.333
<b>they remain constantly engaged in ensuring</b>

91
00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:05.291
<b>that your definition of success</b>

92
00:06:05.291 --> 00:06:08.708
<b>would be suitable for your children as well.</b>

93
00:06:08.708 --> 00:06:10.333
<b>Moreover,</b>

94
00:06:10.333 --> 00:06:13.916
<b>life is unpredictable.</b>

95
00:06:13.916 --> 00:06:16.083
<b>Many such turns will come</b>

96
00:06:16.083 --> 00:06:19.666
<b>that we cannot foresee.</b>

97
00:06:19.666 --> 00:06:24.875
<b>In such circumstances, what's essential</b>
<b>is not to create a predefined map of life</b>

98
00:06:24.875 --> 00:06:29.125
<b>and expect our children to follow it exactly.</b>

99
00:06:29.125 --> 00:06:33.416
<b>What's essential is to awaken in them</b>

100
00:06:33.416 --> 00:06:36.916
<b>the capability to forge their own path in life.</b>

101
00:06:36.916 --> 00:06:41.583
<b>It's necessary that we encourage their talents,</b>

102
00:06:41.583 --> 00:06:43.875
<b>instill good values in them,</b>

103
00:06:43.875 --> 00:06:48.500
<b>and simultaneously strengthen them mentally.</b>

104
00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:50.916
<b>When parents do this,</b>

105
00:06:50.916 --> 00:06:55.333
<b>children will write their own definition of success,</b>

106
00:06:55.333 --> 00:07:00.166
<b>become capable of handling life's</b>
<b>ups and downs on their own,</b>

107
00:07:00.166 --> 00:07:04.041
<b>and because this map is of their own making,</b>

108
00:07:04.041 --> 00:07:09.833
<b>they will learn to take responsibility</b>
<b>for their own life.</b>

109
00:07:09.833 --> 00:07:13.458
<b>Prepare your children in this way.</b>

110
00:07:13.458 --> 00:07:17.083
<b>Don't hand them a pre-drawn map of life;</b>

111
00:07:17.083 --> 00:07:21.416
<b>instead, empower them</b>
<b>to discover their own path,</b>

112
00:07:21.416 --> 00:07:23.250
<b>to walk upon it,</b>

113
00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:27.875
<b>to write their own definition of success.</b>

114
00:07:28.458 --> 00:07:32.541


115
00:07:32.541 --> 00:07:35.583
<b>The same type of work day after day,</b>

116
00:07:35.583 --> 00:07:36.750
<b>the same people,</b>

117
00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:41.416
<b>along with ongoing personal issues.</b>

118
00:07:41.416 --> 00:07:47.333
<b>All these combined sometimes make</b>
<b>the workplace feel monotonous.</b>

119
00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:50.541
<b>If you hold a leadership position,</b>

120
00:07:50.541 --> 00:07:53.083
<b>you know</b>

121
00:07:53.083 --> 00:07:59.625
<b>how essential it is to maintain</b>
<b>your colleagues' enthusiasm.</b>

122
00:07:59.625 --> 00:08:04.416
<b>To keep alive their passion for their work.</b>

123
00:08:04.416 --> 00:08:08.583
<b>For this, perhaps you try various methods,</b>

124
00:08:08.583 --> 00:08:14.958
<b>such as rewards, words of motivation,</b>
<b>continuous training.</b>

125
00:08:14.958 --> 00:08:17.291
<b>All these are necessary.</b>

126
00:08:17.291 --> 00:08:18.666
<b>But</b>

127
00:08:18.666 --> 00:08:25.083
<b>here is another approach,</b>
<b>which is even more effective</b>

128
00:08:25.083 --> 00:08:26.500
<b>and those are</b>

129
00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.708
<b>challenges.</b>

130
00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:31.666
<b>Human potential knows no bounds,</b>

131
00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:32.958
<b>especially</b>

132
00:08:32.958 --> 00:08:37.666
<b>when one has accepted a task as a challenge.</b>

133
00:08:37.666 --> 00:08:45.250
<b>If you observe, monotony sets in</b>
<b>when work begins to feel excessively simple.</b>

134
00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.083
<b>But</b>

135
00:08:46.083 --> 00:08:50.041
<b>when we willingly embrace a challenge,</b>

136
00:08:50.041 --> 00:08:53.333
<b>it brings within us new energy,</b>

137
00:08:53.333 --> 00:09:00.500
<b>a desire to see every situation in fresh ways,</b>
<b>enthusiasm within us.</b>

138
00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.500
<b>Here, what's essential</b>

139
00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:06.791
<b>is that your colleagues embrace this challenge.</b>

140
00:09:06.791 --> 00:09:09.083
<b>For this, there are two approaches.</b>

141
00:09:09.083 --> 00:09:10.458
<b>First</b>

142
00:09:10.458 --> 00:09:14.166
<b>Remind them of all those instances</b>

143
00:09:14.166 --> 00:09:20.541
<b>when they completed tasks far bigger,</b>
<b>far more complex than they expected.</b>

144
00:09:20.541 --> 00:09:22.125
<b>Second</b>

145
00:09:22.125 --> 00:09:28.208
<b>After giving them a challenge,</b>
<b>ensure their success yourself.</b>

146
00:09:28.208 --> 00:09:29.750
<b>Through guidance,</b>

147
00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.125
<b>through support,</b>

148
00:09:31.125 --> 00:09:32.791
<b>by lending a hand.</b>

149
00:09:32.791 --> 00:09:36.083
<b>Once they overcome this challenge,</b>

150
00:09:36.083 --> 00:09:42.125
<b>enthusiasm and confidence for the</b>
<b>future will naturally awaken within them.</b>

151
00:09:42.125 --> 00:09:43.166
<b>And then</b>

152
00:09:43.166 --> 00:09:47.750
<b>they will be able to successfully</b>
<b>complete future challenges.</b>

